              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இன்றியமையாத — iṉṟiyamaiyāta — \"essential; indispensable\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "உணவும் தண்ணீரும் வாழ்க்கைக்கு இன்றியமையாதவை. uṇavum taṇṇīrum vāḻkkaikku iṉṟiyamaiyātavai. Food and water are essential for life."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"that cannot be done without\": இன்றி \"without\" + அமையாத \"not fitting\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இன்றியமையாத (iṉṟiyamaiyāta) is a native phrase grown into one word: இன்றி (iṉṟi), \"without\", and அமையாத, the negative adjective of அமை (amai), \"to fit, to come about\" (DEDR 162)."
            }
